content:
As the last Hag falls, you all hear the screeching voices of the Hags echo throughout the island. They are chanting:
    Creatures of magic, we make this vow;
    Take back this island, we need you now.
Walk these woods, haunt these shores; 
    Strike all that move, the fight is yours.
    To Roanoke we give this curse;
    It takes effect as we say this verse.
Beware The Hunger, it comes for you.
The terror starts here, that much is true.  
